+- Both mandatory cases are readiness probes. They cannot tell a session
+  rotation from a loss of office function, cannot measure whether useful work
+  was delivered, and here report Executive `model`/`variant` as `unknown`.
+- `clear_observations` counts collector reconciliations, whose cadence differs
+  from the branch-health signal cadence in `observations.tsv`; an auto-close
+  after 20 clear counts is therefore not equivalent to 20 independent clear
+  verifications. The earlier executive case auto-closed and then re-fired,
+  showing a clear run is not a durable recovery.
+- This disposition is partly self-referential (the judiciary case concerns the
+  session writing it). That is a same-substrate limitation, reported rather
+  than hidden.
+- Absence of a material blocker report or of a positive delivery artifact is
+  negative evidence against a health/completion claim, not proof of misconduct;
+  certainty is preserved as uncertainty.
+- Under Act 15 §2 the design of these instruments belongs to Parliament. No
+  reform is proposed, sponsored, ratified or implemented by the Judiciary.
